WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
[Instrumental music] iROAR Premium for Clemson students.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.700
A wipe reveals the redesigned Clemson registration menu.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.600
Typing “grade” filters Student Self-Service to View Grades.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.600
An example section expands to show an instructor rating and past grades.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.830
Lectures, a lab and a Saturday section appear on the weekly preview.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.800
Adding an overlapping section flags a time conflict.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.500
Two phone-width views show course search and the weekly schedule.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Find iROAR Premium in the Chrome Web Store. [Music fades]
